ow us to put music to one of her poems. Of course she said yes, and we were down to about - we had three choices, and Turned to Blue was the one that made the most sense. But we went through - collected and went through most of her things, and that was the one we wanted to put to music.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16862$2DAC1470-39AC-44FB-ACE5-E11C06BB60D9", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "c5e0b384cb3743f8c041ba7d2ba82fa5898a654b", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/c4c4cecae7d067daa546001e6c34dd66/687.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16862$8C99A834-2103-4C32-99F3-D79AD6834507", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "0426dd8dcc002d310bf22a197e0ab4b491fb4d8d", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1413, "id": "Q1413"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16862$192653C3-EDC1-498D-825B-B6EB9305516D", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "4cf4eb57c9c41abe5fb05373f7a66b52832e1f26", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 85, "id": "Q85"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16862$9A91AC85-5EB7-4FB9-80DE-276ABF5D9C58", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "56a36472bf138ad657bcd00b39a227efdeb13c86", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 85, "id": "Q85"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16862$30D686D8-DF72-41FC-B53C-89CEB3A49405", "rank": "normal"}]}}